\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {II}{\ignorespaces The drainhole clock in physical units. The production throat ($a=2$, $m=1$, $R_\star =3.89\,M$) scaled by its ADM mass $M$: $\tau =5.9\,M$ is the e-fold time of Sec.~\ref {sec:single:instability}, and the last three columns are the measured times to horizon formation for the two declared kicks and for the unkicked throat left to truncation noise (Sec.~\ref {sec:single:branching}). Intermediate seeds follow $t_{\rm  BH}\simeq 11\,M+\tau \ln (10^{-2}/\varepsilon )$.}}{6}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:scales}{{II}{6}{The drainhole clock in physical units. The production throat ($a=2$, $m=1$, $R_\star =3.89\,M$) scaled by its ADM mass $M$: $\tau =5.9\,M$ is the e-fold time of Sec.~\ref {sec:single:instability}, and the last three columns are the measured times to horizon formation for the two declared kicks and for the unkicked throat left to truncation noise (Sec.~\ref {sec:single:branching}). Intermediate seeds follow $t_{\rm BH}\simeq 11\,M+\tau \ln (10^{-2}/\varepsilon )$}{table.2}{}}
