\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The pure quadrupole's collapse, fully instrumented (`no kick' arm: $\varepsilon _2=0.01$, radial kick zero). (a)~Minimal-surface areal radius (ink) and the oriented scan's MOTS (gold) from $t=33$: $R$ falls $3.80\to 2.41$ and $M_{\rm  MS}$ $1.90\to 1.24$---phantom infall removes mass. (b)--(d)~Global $\min \alpha $, $\min \chi $ (the origin monitor, the far sheet's compactified infinity) and $\max |K|$; the violent phase is $t=45$--$55$. (e)--(f)~The radial profile's 128 shells over $t=33$--$55$ (light = early): $|K|$ grows inward while $\alpha $ pinches to zero at the centre. (g)~Constraint norms; the late rise from $t\gtrsim 75$ is this family's known sphere-local floor growth, shared with the unkicked control.}}{7}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:single_collapse}{{2}{7}{The pure quadrupole's collapse, fully instrumented (`no kick' arm: $\varepsilon _2=0.01$, radial kick zero). (a)~Minimal-surface areal radius (ink) and the oriented scan's MOTS (gold) from $t=33$: $R$ falls $3.80\to 2.41$ and $M_{\rm MS}$ $1.90\to 1.24$---phantom infall removes mass. (b)--(d)~Global $\min \alpha $, $\min \chi $ (the origin monitor, the far sheet's compactified infinity) and $\max |K|$; the violent phase is $t=45$--$55$. (e)--(f)~The radial profile's 128 shells over $t=33$--$55$ (light = early): $|K|$ grows inward while $\alpha $ pinches to zero at the centre. (g)~Constraint norms; the late rise from $t\gtrsim 75$ is this family's known sphere-local floor growth, shared with the unkicked control}{figure.2}{}}
